{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Bebop</strong> is a compact action-incremental game with straightforward gameplay: dodge, shoot, collect tokens, and upgrade your talents. Your character grows stronger over time, and the controls become progressively easier, until enemies fill the screen and vanish like white flames on a CRT monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game avoids complex build strategies, demanding reflexes, or lengthy progression and failure penalties. Simply move your fingers and let the retro visuals and psychedelic music guide you through a relaxing, self-contained journey.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877960?t=1771769160","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877960?t=1771769160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877960/6ec8465bbd9f3815bb44f806777105b2c5ec0b87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771769160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877960/6ec8465bbd9f3815bb44f806777105b2c5ec0b87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771769160","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4063230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Bebop</strong> is a compact action-incremental game with straightforward gameplay: dodge, shoot, collect tokens, and upgrade your talents. Your character grows stronger over time, and the controls become progressively easier, until enemies fill the screen and vanish like white flames on a CRT monitor.